  (text "Notes\nJ1: GND VBAT EN(18) SCL2 SDA2 3V3(LDO2): a straight XH 6 lead from the carrier's J12\nR1: Off through sleep and reset\nR3: Holds Q1 off\nC3: Soft start, about 0.4 ms\nU1: Boost to 5.1 V; EN tied to IN, Q1 does the switching\nR6: V5 = 0.6 V x (1 + 750k / 100k)\nU2: Used across its two outputs: +12 V to -12 V is the field side's 24 V; 0V (pin 5) unconnected\nU5: Side 1 from LDO2, side 2 from V33I\nU3: 40 V in to out\nR8: 1 %\nR9: 1 %; Vout = 1.25 V x (1 + 240 / 150) = 3.25 V\nU4: ADDR to VDD: 0x49\nQ3: Current limiter: trim RV1 for 25 - 30 mA into a short\nR2: The shunt: 0.4 - 2.0 V for 4 - 20 mA\nJ2: Loop + (24 V), loop -\nQ4: Current limiter: trim RV2 for about 25 mA into a short\nR14: Divider: A2 = probe x 0.4\nC12: Holds A2 for the ADC's sampling\nJ3: Probe supply (24 V), 0 V, signal (0 - 5 V)" (at 20 225 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 2892b489-41ee-5b3f-af36-514c51b574fe))
